    "detailed_description": "In this RPG, you awake to find a dog on your bed. You then go on an adventure to try and bring it back home and save your town from the monster in the forest!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An original story where you won\u2019t know where it\u2019s going! I made the basis for this story and it\u2019s worlds on two pieces of papers while in class over 9 years ago!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Created by one person except for the music!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Original art and music within.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Funny jokes and stuff. I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll make you laugh at least once!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- On screen encounters.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Hug your way to victory!</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You need to know!</h2>This is also a short game that should take approx 3 hours to finish. Take it as a one off game as it will be a while before I get back to making the other parts. Take this game as a piece of art that you can enjoy and experience and most importantly, have fun!",
    "about_the_game": "In this RPG, you awake to find a dog on your bed. You then go on an adventure to try and bring it back home and save your town from the monster in the forest!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- An original story where you won\u2019t know where it\u2019s going! I made the basis for this story and it\u2019s worlds on two pieces of papers while in class over 9 years ago!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Created by one person except for the music!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Original art and music within.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Funny jokes and stuff. I\u2019m sure it\u2019ll make you laugh at least once!</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- On screen encounters.</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">- Hug your way to victory!</ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You need to know!</h2>This is also a short game that should take approx 3 hours to finish. Take it as a one off game as it will be a while before I get back to making the other parts. Take this game as a piece of art that you can enjoy and experience and most importantly, have fun!",
